1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Founding Ancestor of the Book : ''Our Norwegian Moe family in america, descendants of Jens and Kari Moe, By Maxine Moe Zilk and Gwendolyn Brouse''  "Viewed in All Copies".
2 CONT
2 CONT http://norwayancestors.com/getperson.php?personID=I8229&tree=tree3 born 1814 Øvregard, Lærdal, Sogn og Fjordane, Norway died 1864 on the Mo Farm in Sæltøyni
2 CONT
2 CONT Married first to Hans Henrikson Øvre Voll Eråker, ca 1835, divorced ca ?,, with  first Marriage they begat Anna Hansdatter in 1836, who Married to Mons Quam, of this is the Moe-Quam line.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married second in 1841 to Jens Olson Saltkjelen Mo they begat the MOE FAMILY IN AMERICA, lines eight living children were born in this listing:
2 CONT
2 CONT         1. Anna Jensdatter of 1841 D.Y.
2 CONT  	2. Anna Jensd. Mo,   b. 16 May 1842, Mo, Lærdal,   d. 1845, Lærdal. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  	3. Mari Jensd. Mo,   b. 1844, Mo, Lærdal,   d. 1854, Lærdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	4. Kari Jensd. Saltkjelen,   b. 1847, Saltkjelen, Mo, Lærdal,   d. 1924, Lærdal. 
2 CONT
2 CONT  	5. Jens Jensson Moe,   b. 9 Jun 1850, Mo, Lærdal  d. 17 Oct 1912, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	6. Anders Jensson Sæltkjelen Mo,   b. 1853, Sæltkjelen, Mo, Lærdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	7. Ola Jensson Moe,   b. 7 Jun 1856, Mo, Lærdal,   d. 18 Sep 1915, Minnesota.
2 CONT
2 CONT  	8. Per Jensson Mo,   b. Abt 1857, Mo, Lærdal''.
2 CONT
2 CONT in the Our Norwegian Moe Family in America it mentions Anna Quam as Jens Stepdaughter, as shown on her Emigration census. the children and descendants are mentioned within as well.
