2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/164030038/guri-nelson
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Norway. Married Einar Nelson on May 3, 1840. Raised 8 children. Emigrated to USA in 1854. Died at the age of 92 on a farm in New Lisbon. Her husband Einar is buried in the Greenwood Cemetery near Hillsboro.
2 CONT
2 CONT New Lisbon Times Obit, “Funeral services were held in the East Lemonweir Norwegian Lutheran Church on Nov. 28. Rev. C. Hjermstadt officiating. Burial was in the church yard. She has made her home with her daughter, Mrs. Hans Weste
2 CONC rn in the Town of Lisbon where she passed away on Nov. 25, 1913.”
