2 CONT " in the Norwegian archives in Bergen, Norway had the information that Anders Moe was born 16 June and Baptized  3 July 1853. Married on 30 January 1873 to Ingeleif Pedersdtr, Lysne, Born 1839, 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''He was a farmer, His family came to america from Norway, he was said to have been an old grandfather and Ida his wife was remembered as a Matriarch of the Moe family, some of the last descendants remember her as being in a rocki
2 CONC ng chair, with a blanket and trying to get up every morning, until she couldn't anymore to go to church she was a Lutheran, she had shakes.''
2 CONT
