2 CONT It is Believed that Jens Died when Ole was a Young man, and Kari Pedersdtr died When he was three. in the census of 1865 of Laerdal Norway, Ole at age nine was mentioned as a Foster child of the Cottager https://www.geni.com/peopl
2 CONC e/Johannes-Moe/6000000054191851947?through=6000000054191717894 and wife https://www.geni.com/people/Sissel-Moe/6000000054192212832?through=6000000054191851947, Which would verify that both Parents Jens and Kari where both deceased
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Sine Bertine Moe, said Andrew, Jens and Ole came to America at the same time, but according to the census of 1900 Jens came about 1882 and Andrew and his wife, and daughter came in 1885.
2 CONT
2 CONT The census did not say when Anna came, (Anna Hansdatter Quam or Anna Jensdatter Moe) Ole 's trunk has the year 1874 engraved on it, Basic Assumption that it could be the Emigration date,
2 CONT
