0 @N6000000005564356534@ NOTE Ble hogget i venstre hånd og deretter stukket i hjel av Hans Hendrich Urdahl hjemme på Stele. Kården gikk tvers gjennom kroppen.Drepen med kårde av    Hans Hendrik Urdahl heime på Stele. Han vart først hoggen i venstre hand, deret
1 CONC ter stukken tvert gjennom kroppen.
0 @N6000000005083323619@ NOTE Andrew worked in a general store in LeRoy, MN, where he met Carrie Share.  He then was employed in Adams, eventually building the Daylight Store.  The store was open every evening, so Andrew was quite busy.  One family religiously
1 CONC  came to town every Saturday evening at 11:00 PM and Andrew had to keep the store open until they left.
1 CONT
1 CONT When Oscar and Nordeen were little, Carrie would send them to the store to get a soup bone.  For $.05 they could get a bone that was so big the two little boys could hardly carry it.
1 CONT
1 CONT In approximately 1919, Carrie had an ear infection so bad that the doctor advised her to move temporarily to a warmer climate.  Andrew, Carrie and Ruth took the train to California where they spent six months sightseeing.  Tenas (
1 CONC CarrieÕs nephew) and Mattie Share had just been married, so they spent their honeymoon with the Torgersons in California.  (As told by Ruth Torgerson Thune).
0 @N6000000005083534051@ NOTE Andrew worked in a general store in LeRoy, MN, where he met Carrie Share.  He then was employed in Adams, eventually building the Daylight Store.  The store was open every evening, so Andrew was quite busy.  One family religiously
1 CONC  came to town every Saturday evening at 11:00 PM and Andrew had to keep the store open until they left.
1 CONT
1 CONT When Oscar and Nordeen were little, Carrie would send them to the store to get a soup bone.  For $.05 they could get a bone that was so big the two little boys could hardly carry it.
1 CONT
1 CONT In approximately 1919, Carrie had an ear infection so bad that the doctor advised her to move temporarily to a warmer climate.  Andrew, Carrie and Ruth took the train to California where they spent six months sightseeing.  Tenas (
1 CONC CarrieÕs nephew) and Mattie Share had just been married, so they spent their honeymoon with the Torgersons in California.  (As told by Ruth Torgerson Thune).
